    "created_at": "2016-10-16T04:37:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-16T05:03:46Z",
    "body": "We can take `li.value` as a reference. It has the same behavior among browsers that, if `value` attribute is not specified, it returns `0`. I think `start` IDL attribute should have the same behavior.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/254027098/reactions",
